  "title": "Binary Fractions / Normalization",
  "parentId": null,
  "hidden": false,
  "markdown": "##### Binary Fractions / Normalization\n\n• 小数位权：.b₁b₂…₂ = b₁×2−1 + b₂×2−2 + …；.11₂ = 0.75\n\n• Decimal Fraction → Binary：小数连续 ×2，每次取整数位 0/1；余下小数继续，直到为 0 或需要舍入\n\n• Normalize 正规化：移二进制小数点至 1.F₂ × 2e；左移 → e 增，右移 → e 减\n",
